  "logline": "Disgraced violinist Anna Richter accepts a chair in the Aurelia Orchestra, an ensemble that performs only at 3 a.m. to empty halls — until she recognizes, in next week's program, the exact sequence of the concert that preceded her sister's death, note for note.",
